### crear producto sin token → 401
POST {{base}}/api/admin/productos
Content-Type: application/json

{"marcaId":"{{marcaId}}","nombre":"Sin token","metodologiaRotacion":"FIFO"}

### crear producto con token de cliente → 403
POST {{base}}/api/admin/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCliente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"marcaId":"{{marcaId}}","nombre":"Sin permiso","metodologiaRotacion":"FIFO"}

### crear variante con código ya usado → 409
POST {{base}}/api/admin/variantes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDueno}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productoId":"{{productoId}}","codigo":"VS-LOVE-236","nombre":"Duplicada","precioMinoristaCentavos":10000,"precioMayoristaCentavos":8000}

### agregar imagen → 201
# @name agregarImagen
POST {{base}}/api/admin/variantes/{{varianteId}}/imagenes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDueno}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"referenciaImagen":"https://example.com/imagen.jpg","orden":1}

### agregar imagen con body inválido → 400
POST {{base}}/api/admin/variantes/{{varianteId}}/imagenes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDueno}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"referenciaImagen":""}

### agregar imagen a variante inexistente → 404
POST {{base}}/api/admin/variantes/{{inexistente}}/imagenes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDueno}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"referenciaImagen":"https://example.com/imagen.jpg"}

### definir imagen principal → 204
PUT {{base}}/api/admin/variantes/{{varianteId}}/imagen-principal
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDueno}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"imagenId":"{{imagenId}}"}

### definir imagen principal con body inválido → 400
PUT {{base}}/api/admin/variantes/{{varianteId}}/imagen-principal
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDueno}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"imagenId":"invalido"}

### definir imagen principal inexistente → 404
PUT {{base}}/api/admin/variantes/{{varianteId}}/imagen-principal
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDueno}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"imagenId":"{{inexistente}}"}

### quitar imagen → 204
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/imagenes/{{imagenId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDueno}}

### quitar imagen con id inválido → 400
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/imagenes/invalido
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDueno}}

### quitar imagen inexistente → 404
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/imagenes/{{inexistente}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDueno}}
